            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present technology relates to a wireless communication device and a wireless communication method that enable easy construction of a network group of access points.The wireless communication device includes: a signal generation unit that, on the basis of a first signal that includes access point identification information for identifying an access point that configures a network group according to a user's instruction, generates a second signal that includes the access point identification information, and includes network identification information for identifying an access-point network group to which the access point makes an entry; and a communication control unit that receives the first signal from the access point, and performs control of transmitting the second signal to the access point. The present technology can be applied to, for example, a station of a communication system that conforms to the standards of IEEE 802.11.</p>
            </abstract>
